  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;JONATHAN CANTWELL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jonathan Cantwell is an Australian road racing cyclist who seeks a fresh start in Chile after dominating the European circuit."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANDES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Andes is a mountain range in South America, casting a warm orange glow over Chillán as the sun sets."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHILLÁN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chillán is a city in Chile where Jonathan Cantwell arrives, known for its bustling streets and vibrant market."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EUROPEAN CIRCUIT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The European circuit refers to the professional cycling competitions in Europe where Jonathan Cantwell previously competed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUTH AMERICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"South America is the region where Jonathan Cantwell seeks new challenges, particularly the rugged terrain and unpredictable weather."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLUB DEPORTIVO ÑUBLENSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Club Deportivo Ñublense is a Chilean football club that Don Pedro, the café owner, is a die-hard fan of."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DON PEDRO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Don Pedro is the owner of a café in Chillán and a die-hard fan of Club Deportivo Ñublense."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHILEAN LEAGUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Chilean league is the football league where Club Deportivo Ñublense competes and is struggling to find its footing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CYCLING NEWS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cycling News is a media outlet that reported on Jonathan Cantwell's signing with V Australia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;V AUSTRALIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"V Australia is a professional cycling team founded in 2009, seeking riders who share their vision and commitment to excellence."&lt;SEP&gt;"V Australia is a sports organization where Cantwell has been riding and has achieved notable results."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHRIS SUTTON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chris Sutton is a teammate of Jonathan Cantwell at V Australia, praising his work ethic and leadership skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BERNARD SULZBERGER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bernard Sulzberger is a teammate of Jonathan Cantwell at V Australia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DAVID KEMP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"David Kemp is a teammate of Jonathan Cantwell at V Australia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIAN NATIONAL ROAD RACE CHAMPIONSHIPS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Australian National Road Race Championships is a cycling event where Jonathan Cantwell won in 2010."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOUR OF UTAH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Tour of Utah is a cycling event where Jonathan Cantwell won a stage in 2010."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOUR OF CALIFORNIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Tour of California is a cycling event where Jonathan Cantwell finished in the top 10 in 2010."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHILEAN MARKET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Chilean market is where Jonathan Cantwell cycles through, filled with vibrant stalls and the aroma of food."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHORIPÁN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"FOOD"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Choripán is a type of grilled sausage that is mentioned as an aroma in the market."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRESHLY BREWED COFFEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DRINK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Freshly brewed coffee is mentioned as an aroma in the market, tempting Jonathan Cantwell's senses."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAFÉ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The café is a cozy spot where Jonathan Cantwell stops for a bite, with a vintage Club Deportivo Ñublense jersey on the wall."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VINTAGE CLUB DEPORTIVO ÑUBLENSE JERSEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ITEM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A vintage Club Deportivo Ñublense jersey is hanging on the wall of the café, contrasting with European teams Jonathan is used to."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CYCLING WEEKLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cycling Weekly is a media outlet that published an interview praising Jonathan Cantwell's work ethic."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2009&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2009 is also the year when V Australia was founded and when Jonathan Cantwell signed with the team."&lt;SEP&gt;"2009 is the year when Jonathan Cantwell joined V Australia, marking a significant milestone in his career."&lt;SEP&gt;"2009 is the year when V Australia was founded and when Jonathan Cantwell joined the team."&lt;SEP&gt;"2009 is the year when V Australia was founded and when Jonathan Cantwell signed with the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;2010&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2010 is also the year when Jonathan Cantwell won a stage at the Tour of Utah and finished in the top 10 at the Tour of California."&lt;SEP&gt;"2010 is the year when Jonathan Cantwell won the Australian National Road Race Championships."&lt;SEP&gt;"2010 is the year when Jonathan Cantwell's results began to speak for themselves, including winning the Australian National Road Race Championships."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANTWELL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cantwell is a person who pushes himself to be better and positively influences others on the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YEARS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TIME"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Years refer to the duration during which Cantwell has been associated with V Australia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0093</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IMPRESSIVE ARRAY OF RESULTS&quot;">
